<title>USA: Stanley Furniture Co Inc Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Stanley Furniture Co Inc Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>STANLEYTOWN, Va. 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>				Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>				Sep 29,  Oct. 1,     Sep 29,  Oct. 1,</p>
<p>				   1996     1995	  1996     1995</p>
<p> Net sales		  $52,550  $44,706    $148,023 $127,858</p>
<p> Net income		  $2,861     $998	$6,147   $2,511</p>
<p> Net income per shr	   .58	.21	  1.27	.53</p>
<p> Diluted net per shr	  .57	.21	  1.22	.53</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     4,954    4,728	 4,848    4,728</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 periods include a gain of $246,000, or $0.05 a share, from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>1995 nine month period includes $136,000 charge from unusual items.</p>
</text>
